rong one i meant the fifth\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0018\", \"v\": [[\"I'm making a birthday card and want some nice shots for it, so could you show me photos of Takeshi Sokolov?\", \"Different thing: I'm revising for a bug walk, so what notes have I got in my Entomology notebook?\"], [\"photos of Takeshi Sokolov\", \"Entomology notebook notes\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0019\", \"v\": [[\"umm who's… who's coming to the cinder?\", \"ok and, uh, do I have any events about porridge?\", \"what about paddle?\", \"hmm is it in my photos as well?\", \"oh wait hang on, can you find the documents on cinder?\", \"ok right, back to the paddle stuff. the night one, who's in it?\"], [\"I need to sort out numbers for food, so who is coming to the cinder?\", \"Different thing, I have a feeling I put something in the diary. Do I have any events about porridge?\", \"Hmm, what about paddle? I might have filed it under that instead.\", \"Is it in my photos as well? I'm fairly sure I took a picture.\", \"Hang on, before I forget, I need the paperwork. Could you find the documents on cinder?\", \"Okay, going back to the paddle events from before: the night one, who's in it? I can't remember who came.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0020\", \"v\": [[\"cinder, when?\"], [\"Could you tell me when the cinder is, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0021\", \"v\": [[\"expenses in cinder fund?\", \"Verbier one, how much?\"], [\"umm what expenses are in the, uh, cinder fund group?\", \"and how much was the Verbier one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0022\", \"v\": [[\"The tree in the garden has been on my mind all week, so what have I got about magnolia?\", \"About the call one, who else is going to be there? I'd like to know before it happens.\", \"Could you find me pictures with any of those people in them? I'm thinking of making a little collage.\"], [\"Could you tell me what I have about magnolia, please?\", \"Regarding the call one, would you mind telling me who else will be there?\", \"Thank you. Would you please find any pictures with any of those people in them?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0023\", \"v\": [[\"had coffee with Gemma today, log it\", \"Ahlberg\", \"make me a new router password\", \"pennant two hours later\"], [\"Just got back from a catch-up. I had coffee with Gemma today, could you log that?\", \"Oh sorry, it was the Ahlberg one, I should've said.\", \"Different thing: the wifi's been dodgy and I want to reset it, so can you come up with a new router password for me?\", \"Fair enough. Also, the day's getting crowded, so could you move the pennant two hours later?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0024\", \"v\": [[\"had coffee w Gemma the physio today, log it pls\", \"what events is she coming to\", \"who else will be there\", \"diff q, did i delete the medallion photo?\", \"bring it back pls\", \"also bump the Gitedale an hour later\"], [\"Just back from a nice catch-up. I had coffee with Gemma, the physio one, today, so could you log it?\", \"While I'm thinking of her, what events is she coming to?\", \"And who else is going to be there? I'm curious who I'll bump into.\", \"Separate thing: I was tidying the camera roll and now I can't find it. Did I delete the medallion photo?\", \"Oh, I liked that one. Could you bring it back?\", \"Also, I'm running behind on everything, so can you bump the Gitedale an hour later?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0025\", \"v\": [[\"who shares Gitedale with me?\", \"pics with Ludmila\", \"star the crate booking paperwork\"], [\"umm who's… who am I sharing Gitedale with?\", \"oh and, uh, can you show me pictures with Ludmila in them?\", \"and, er, can you put a star on the crate booking paperwork?\"]]}","ttft_ms":34709,"type":"result","duration_ms":49798,"uuid":"3b3c1bac-5413-4214-85ce-c933abc1e14c","ttft_stream_ms":1318,"time_to_request_ms":140,"first_content_frame_ms":1319,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22141074,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278691592.022,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
